%
( FREZE - PARAMETRIK DELIK DESENI )
( Makine: Mill / BenchMill. Kutuk: 120 x 80 x 30 mm, X/Y sifiri ortada, Z0 ust yuzey )
( T2 = 6mm parmak freze, matkap gibi kullanilir )
( Delik sayisi, cember yaricapi ve derinlik asagidaki degiskenlerden gelir; )
( sayilari degistirip programi yeniden yukleyin )

#<delik_sayisi> = 8
#<cember_r> = 28.0
#<derinlik> = -8.0

G21 G17 G90 G54

T2 M6
G43
S3200 M3
G0 Z10.0

( --- cember uzerinde delikler: aci dongusu --- )
#<i> = 0
o100 while [#<i> LT #<delik_sayisi>]
  #<aci> = [#<i> * 360.0 / #<delik_sayisi>]
  G0 X[#<cember_r> * COS[#<aci>]] Y[#<cember_r> * SIN[#<aci>]]
  G0 Z2.0
  G1 Z#<derinlik> F100
  G0 Z2.0
  #<i> = [#<i> + 1]
o100 endwhile

( --- dort kosede delik: G81 delme cevrimi, G80 ile kapatilir --- )
G98
G81 X-50.0 Y-30.0 Z#<derinlik> R2.0 F100
X50.0
Y30.0
X-50.0
G80

( --- ortada kademeli delme: G83, her dalmada 3mm --- )
G83 X0.0 Y0.0 Z-15.0 R2.0 Q3.0 F100
G80
G0 Z50.0

M5
G0 X0.0 Y0.0
M2
%
